        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "question": "Cos θ = (u⃗·v⃗)/(||u⃗||·||v⃗||) = 1/(1×√2) = √2/2 → θ = π/4 = 45°."
      },
      {
        "type": "qcm",
        "question": "L'identité de polarisation donne u⃗·v⃗ en fonction des normes :",
        "choices": [
          "u⃗·v⃗ = ||u⃗+v⃗||² − ||u⃗−v⃗||²",
          "u⃗·v⃗ = (||u⃗+v⃗||² − ||u⃗−v⃗||²)/4",
          "u⃗·v⃗ = ||u⃗||² + ||v⃗||²",
          "u⃗·v⃗ = ||u⃗+v⃗||/2"
        ]
      },
